<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Velto – Coming Soon</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background-color: #631f3a;
      color: #f2d3cc;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin: 0.5em 0;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0.5em 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Velto</h1>
  <p>Coming Soon</p>
  <p>Tuft is coming to cut through the ordinary. Coming soon.</p>
</body>
</html>
